a7s3-plus Licensing Summary
===========================

1. Original Open Gate 3:2, Cinema Menu Unlocks, and Host Tooling
   (`analysis/*`, `runtime/cp_opengate_patch.cpp`, `runtime/menu_repair.cpp`,
   `runtime/high_res_display_v10.cpp`, `runtime/og_menu_daemon.cpp`,
   `runtime/og_menu_loader.cpp`, `runtime/og_3840x2560_*.cpp`,
   `runtime/persistent_preload.c`, `docs/*`)
   Copyright (c) 2026 ilovemycamera (@ilovemycamera)
   Licensed under the MIT License (when used standalone) or GPL-2.0-or-later
   when combined with the DOOM engine module.

2. DOOM Port for Sony Bionz XR (`runtime/doomgeneric_a7s3.cpp`, `runtime/doomgeneric/*`)
   Based on doomgeneric (Copyright (c) ozkl) and id Software's Linux DOOM source
   release. Licensed under the GNU General Public License v2.0 (see
   `runtime/doomgeneric/LICENSE` for full GPL-2.0 text).
   NOTE: No WAD game assets (`DOOM1.WAD`) are distributed in this repository.

3. USB / Senser Transport (`sony-pmca-re/*`)
   Copyright (c) ma1co (https://github.com/ma1co/sony-pmca-re)
   Licensed under the MIT License (see `sony-pmca-re/LICENSE.txt`).

